INSERT INTO `document_chunk` VALUES (741, 13, 1, 53, 'rue\n },\n production: {\n apiUrl: \'https://api.example.com/api\',\n timeout: 5000,\n debug: false\n }\n};\n\nconst env = process.env.NODE_ENV || \'development\';\nexport const config = envConfig[env];\n\n// 使用\nimport { config } from \'@/config/env\';\nfetch(`${config.apiUrl}/user/1`);\n```\n\n## 四、完整解决方案：封装请求层\n\n```javascript\n// api/request.js - 完整的请求封装\nimport axios from \'axios\';\nimport { config } from \'@/config/env\';\nimport { DataAdapter } from \'@/utils/adapter\';', 447, 447, 1, '991b5626-8c6c-44df-9655-10d316c2222d', NULL, '2026-03-29 13:57:06');
